  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A student council group is selling school posters for a fundraiser. They use the function <math alttext=\"p left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals 5 x minus 220\"><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>220</mn></math> to determine their profit <math alttext=\"p left parenthesis x right parenthesis\"><mi>p</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>, in dollars, for selling <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> school posters. In order to earn a profit of <math alttext=\"dollar sign 900\"><mo>$</mo><mn>900</mn></math>, how many school posters must they sell?</p>",
  "answerOptions": [],
